Everybody, these people are
trespassers and intruders.

01:08:04.840 --> 01:08:08.360
This is an un-lawful
conspiracy to trespass.

01:08:08.600 --> 01:08:12.120
And you will go Sir,
you will depart immediately,

01:08:12.360 --> 01:08:15.840
before we set the dogs on you.

01:08:16.120 --> 01:08:19.600
For he is a jolly good fellow,
for he is a jolly good fellow,

