01:08:48.080 --> 01:08:52.080
After his retirement, Dave Hartnett
moved to the private sector,

01:08:52.320 --> 01:08:55.800
one of his positions was at
accountancy firm Deloitte;

01:08:56.080 --> 01:08:59.800
where he advises foreign governments
on corporate taxation.

01:09:03.120 --> 01:09:07.120
Dave Hartnett is a Companion
of the Order of the Bath

01:09:07.360 --> 01:09:10.840
an honour bestowed on him
by the British Monarch.

01:09:14.040 --> 01:09:18.120
You have former ministers acting
as advisers to accountancy firms.

01:09:18.360 --> 01:09:22.400
Accountancy firms provide jobs and
consultancies for potential ministers.

01:09:22.640 --> 01:09:26.640
To my mind really, it is an indication
of corrupt structures,

01:09:26.920 --> 01:09:29.640
people are buying and selling influences.

01:09:29.920 --> 01:09:33.360
When a former minister works
for an accountancy firm,

01:09:33.600 --> 01:09:36.600
he is not providing any
accounting knowledge,

01:09:36.840 --> 01:09:40.400
he is opening political opportunities
at home and abroad

01:09:40.640 --> 01:09:42.640
that is what they are doing.

01:09:42.920 --> 01:09:45.400
I hope by now you will share my view

01:09:45.640 --> 01:09:48.560
that I don't trust most bankers,
I don't trust most lawyers,

01:09:48.800 --> 01:09:50.920
I don't trust most accounting firms,

01:09:51.160 --> 01:09:55.040
I actually think they are engaged in a
conspiracy against the public interest.

01:09:57.200 --> 01:10:01.000
In Britain, secrecy and complexity
in finance and government

01:10:01.240 --> 01:10:04.120
help to obscure corruption
in public office.

01:10:04.360 --> 01:10:06.960
Financial structures are often so complex

01:10:07.200 --> 01:10:10.120
that even after they are
publicly revealed,

01:10:10.360 --> 01:10:13.240
they are not widely recognised
for what they are.

01:10:13.520 --> 01:10:18.000
An example of this is PFI,
the Private Finance Initiative.

01:10:18.880 --> 01:10:20.920
PFI is private finance initiative.

01:10:21.160 --> 01:10:23.720
It is a way of funding
public infrastructure,

01:10:23.960 --> 01:10:26.920
things like hospitals, schools,
roads and bridges,

01:10:27.160 --> 01:10:29.400
but financing them via the private sector

01:10:29.640 --> 01:10:33.640
rather than the historical method,
which is via the central government.

01:10:33.920 --> 01:10:37.920
Over a period of 30 or 40 years
the amount of repayment costs

01:10:38.160 --> 01:10:40.760
will be three or four times higher overall,

01:10:41.000 --> 01:10:45.200
than if you had borrowed it from
the central government in the first place.

01:10:45.440 --> 01:10:48.960
So it is basically a
giant accounting scam.

01:10:50.120 --> 01:10:52.920
Once the PFI policy has been set up,

01:10:53.160 --> 01:10:56.920
you find that the big four
accountancy firms were actually

01:10:57.160 --> 01:11:00.640
paid members of staff within
the Treasury Department,

01:11:00.920 --> 01:11:04.120
who were then actually
going around and selling

01:11:04.360 --> 01:11:07.840
and advising upon the
implementation of PFI contracts

01:11:08.120 --> 01:11:10.400
by public authorities.

01:11:11.200 --> 01:11:13.400
Effectively saying, come to us,

01:11:13.640 --> 01:11:17.320
and we will show you how to derive
the most benefit from it.

01:11:17.600 --> 01:11:20.920
In other words, how to perhaps
exploit the legislation.

01:11:21.160 --> 01:11:25.160
Even the offices of the state tax
authority are now owned offshore.

01:11:26.400 --> 01:11:29.800
HMRC, which is the tax
collector here in the UK,

01:11:31.160 --> 01:11:33.760
their offices are owned in Bermuda

01:11:35.320 --> 01:11:37.920
by a company called Mapley STEPS.

01:11:38.160 --> 01:11:40.440
It is quite incredible.

01:11:41.160 --> 01:11:45.640
The company that owns the PFI
contract to run HMRC's head office,

01:11:45.880 --> 01:11:50.120
borrowed money from offshore
investors at 15% interest.

01:11:51.320 --> 01:11:55.800
Because the interest was so high,
the company was losing money,

01:11:56.040 --> 01:11:58.560
therefore it did not pay tax.

01:11:59.840 --> 01:12:04.320
In 2011, HMRC could not prove
that any PFI company

01:12:04.560 --> 01:12:07.280
was paying any tax in the UK.

01:12:09.600 --> 01:12:12.920
I think we need to have a
serious conversation about

01:12:13.160 --> 01:12:15.920
the role of government in
this whole debacle

01:12:16.160 --> 01:12:19.160
and how much have governments
been penetrated by

01:12:19.400 --> 01:12:21.720
big banks and accountancy firms,

01:12:21.960 --> 01:12:25.440
and ultimately in whose
interest it operates.

01:12:26.600 --> 01:12:30.080
Africa PPP Conference: London 2016.

01:12:38.320 --> 01:12:42.320
The reason we were protesting outside
the Africa PPP Conference

01:12:42.560 --> 01:12:46.240
is that we wanted to make sure
that citizens back in Africa

01:12:46.520 --> 01:12:49.520
should hear about the fact
that such policies

01:12:49.760 --> 01:12:52.760
have been a complete
failure here in the UK.

01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:56.920
We know that these products are
not marketed to African countries

01:12:57.160 --> 01:12:59.160
in their own best interest.

01:12:59.400 --> 01:13:03.400
The only motivation is to spread the reach
of financial services into new markets.

01:13:03.640 --> 01:13:07.360
It is all being promoted in the
interests of the City of London.

01:13:07.600 --> 01:13:11.320
What you are seeing is basically
a second form of colonisation.

01:13:11.560 --> 01:13:15.560
You have had initially occupation
and resource extraction

01:13:15.800 --> 01:13:19.000
and through that process
countries like Britain,

01:13:19.240 --> 01:13:21.760
which have had a large offshore empire

01:13:22.000 --> 01:13:25.520
have developed significant networks,
and now those networks

01:13:25.760 --> 01:13:29.240
are being used to promote and
exploit financial services.

01:13:38.080 --> 01:13:42.600
The City of London was the beating
financial heart of the British Empire.

01:13:42.840 --> 01:13:44.960
Britain's Empire declined,

01:13:45.200 --> 01:13:47.200
the City transformed itself

01:13:47.440 --> 01:13:51.160
from a hub operating the
financial machinery of Empire

01:13:51.400 --> 01:13:53.600
into a global financial centre.

01:13:55.720 --> 01:13:58.400
Former insignificant outposts of Empire

01:13:58.640 --> 01:14:03.160
became the basis for a spider's web
of offshore secrecy jurisdictions

01:14:03.400 --> 01:14:06.400
that captured wealth
from across the globe

01:14:06.640 --> 01:14:09.360
and funnelled it to the City of London.

01:14:09.600 --> 01:14:14.200
Today, 25% of international finance
is conducted on British territory.

01:14:15.920 --> 01:14:19.120
Almost half of the world's
secrecy jurisdictions

01:14:19.360 --> 01:14:21.920
are under British protection,

01:14:22.160 --> 01:14:26.920
up to half of offshore wealth may be
hidden in Britain’s offshore havens.

01:14:29.080 --> 01:14:33.280
Financial services is how Britain's
elites make their money,

01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:38.000
and it is also where former government
ministers, senior civil servants

01:14:38.280 --> 01:14:40.920
and retired spooks from MI5 and MI6

01:14:41.160 --> 01:14:45.920
receive lucrative consulting positions
after their time in public service.

01:14:46.480 --> 01:14:50.680
Together they have transformed
Britain and its dependencies

01:14:50.920 --> 01:14:53.400
into the world's largest tax haven,

01:14:53.680 --> 01:14:56.680
harming development
throughout the world,

01:14:56.920 --> 01:14:58.920
and turning Britain itself,

01:14:59.160 --> 01:15:03.640
into a country that serves
above all the interests of its elites.

